## 🚀 Sprint Planning — Sprint 1

**Equipe (Scrum Time):** Fred Gabriel, Giovani Silva, Lucas de Jesus, Gustavo Barbosa, Guilherme Krinski
**Product Owner:** Gustavo Barbosa
**Scrum Master:** Guilherme Krinski

